SpectrumJetson napa-04: streaming NAPA runs a final blob's candidate only once the frame rows it can read
(3 cells + 8 px below the blob) have been fed; until then the blob waits in a per-level list. Found by the
tester's probe (rows pre-filled with 0 or 255 until fed): candidates near the arrived edge read the previous
frame's rows, so decision margins differed from napa_detect. Applies after napa-03.

